  "changes": [
    "Avoid the initial eager KMZLoader attempt in async previews. Index once and extract only selected KML/DAE and declared images through existing shared ZIP access.",
    "Keep the synchronous public API and make its fflate extraction selective; cache selected entry bytes.",
    "Select Model/Link hrefs with KML namespace support; prefer root KML, exact relative paths and archive-root paths, decode percent escapes once, resolve parent segments before normalization and reject ambiguous suffix guesses.",
    "Share one URL per archive image; keep it until all referenced loads finish, then release on success, failure or abort. Borrowed external/data/blob URLs remain caller-owned.",
    "Await used textures before preview construction; warn on missing or broken images while retaining geometry. Missing local references avoid application-HTML fallback requests.",
    "Cancel asynchronous ZIP/index/entry/image waits, observe late failures and dispose abandoned geometry/materials/textures. Export the async warning/options API from the package."
  ],
